  <item>
    <title>令人心动的综艺</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f3f7134775a9c3521ce1b5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f3f7134775a9c3521ce1b5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Sep 2024 11:31:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>想走捷径了，想参加恋综，开油罐频道，录制Q&amp;A，ins涨粉到约1.2M，成为Gucci全球推广大使，和杰伦公园一起看秀。如果不能参加恋综，那就亲手制作一档恋综。</span><br><span></span><br><span>Timeline 收听指引</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> 从小看到大的恋综，必须是——</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 看本地老年恋综，学道地荷兰语</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 韩国恋综为什么这么火</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a> 同事为了支持自己的pick买了好几箱优酸乳</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 明星参加真人秀能有多离谱</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 职场综艺和真实的职场差距太大了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">24:45</a> IP大火，这种综艺在各个国家都卖得好</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a>《塑料袋》节目组也想制作一档综艺</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 这档综艺的名字叫什么呢，请听友袋子们指示</span><br><span>-</span><br><span>主播：绿宝 &amp; Orange </span><br><span>剪辑大师：小e </span><br><span>音乐总监：Bonsai </span><br><span>微博 @绿宝再次苏醒 @OrangeElephantSalmon</span><br><span>IG: suliaodaipod </span><br><span>商务合作：suliaodaipod@gmail.com </span><br><span></span><br><span>感谢你的留言、点赞、收藏和分享！也欢迎有闲钱和大爱的听友们点击文末打赏或在爱发电上支持我们。</span><br></p><span></span><hr><p><a href="https://afdian.com/a/suliaodaipod" data-url="https://afdian.com/a/suliaodaipod"><span>爱发电上赞助</span></a></p>]]></description>
