  <item>
    <title>杏感之神也会有身材焦虑 —— 爱自己才是答案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66eabe7d4775a9c3528af834</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66eabe7d4775a9c3528af834</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Sep 2024 11:33:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>摆脱身材焦虑，健康杏感地生活真的不容易！本期《塑料袋》两名主播想和袋子们一起聊聊如何通过饮食和运动与身材和解，摆脱对“完美身材”的执念。</span><br><span>Timeline 收听指引</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 和营养师谈谈如何对“吃饭”这件事产生健康的觉知</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">08:25</a> 一瓶同品牌的蕃茄酱在美国和欧洲的配料表有天壤之别</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 这个社会对女性外貌真的太苛刻了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="928">15:28</a> 女生拼了老命减肥穿进美美对婚纱，男士婚礼当天却连头都没梳</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 不爱去健身房的原因</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> 无论多微小的进步，都请对自己感到骄傲</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">28:45</a> 爱自己现在的样子真的很重要</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 随便出门上街散个步，在美国怎么这么难</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1995">33:15</a> 不用等自己“准备好”，现在就开始做想做的运动吧</span><br><span>-</span><br><span>主播：绿宝 &amp; Orange </span><br><span>剪辑大师：小e </span><br><span>音乐总监：Bonsai </span><br><span>微博 @绿宝再次苏醒 @OrangeElephantSalmon</span><br><span>IG: suliaodaipod </span><br><span>商务合作：suliaodaipod@gmail.com </span><br><span></span><br><span>感谢你的留言、点赞、收藏和分享！也欢迎有闲钱和大爱的听友们点击文末打赏或在爱发电上支持我们。</span><br></p><span></span><hr><p><a href="https://afdian.com/a/suliaodaipod" data-url="https://afdian.com/a/suliaodaipod"><span>爱发电上赞助</span></a></p>]]></description>
