  <item>
    <title>味蕾的生命周期有多长？我们从小吃到大的美食</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e182dd79de2cd416c7145e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e182dd79de2cd416c7145e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Sep 2024 11:34:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>10~14天味蕾居然就会更新一次！本期《塑料袋》又是两人聊天，邀请袋子们和两位主播一起追忆逝水年华，在浩瀚的美食海洋反复爱上从小到大遇到的美食。</span><br><span></span><br><span>Timeline 收听指引</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 九月初正好是吃小馄饨的日子</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 老北京茄泥和中东 Baba ghanoush 属于远房表亲</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 南方人都讨厌勾芡吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 薄荷巧克力今年为什么那么火</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1255">20:55</a> 小时候第一次去必胜客，感觉真的是很高级的西餐厅</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a> 时代的眼泪 —— 金钱豹</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 漂亮饭值不值还是得看一起吃饭的人是谁</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2172">36:12</a> 莱莱小笼的蟹粉小笼，绝了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2348">39:08</a> 倾囊相授 —— 找到好吃餐厅的小技巧</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2522">42:02</a> 假如流落荒岛只能带一样食物，你会带什么？</span><br><span>-</span><br><span>主播：绿宝 &amp; Orange </span><br><span>剪辑大师：小e </span><br><span>音乐总监：Bonsai </span><br><span>微博 @绿宝再次苏醒 @OrangeElephantSalmon</span><br><span>IG: suliaodaipod </span><br><span>商务合作：suliaodaipod@gmail.com </span><br><span></span><br><span>感谢你的留言、点赞、收藏和分享！也欢迎有闲钱和大爱的听友们点击文末打赏或在爱发电上支持我们。</span><br></p><span></span><hr><p><a href="https://afdian.com/a/suliaodaipod" data-url="https://afdian.com/a/suliaodaipod"><span>爱发电上赞助</span></a></p>]]></description>
