    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>浪漫喜剧，我们从小看到大！即便剧情再过目即忘，男主再不如男二，男女主人公最终都会离谱地爱上对方。本期《塑料袋》依旧是对口相声，橘子和绿宝一起聊聊看过的那些浪漫喜剧。</span><br><span></span><br><span>Timeline 收听指引</span><br><span></span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="292">04:52</a> 万人迷，你真的爱男人吗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> 过目即忘，浪漫喜剧的剧情重要吗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a> 他长得也不帅，但他真的好帅</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 金三顺是我的童年偶像</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 美国贾玲点亮了艾米丽在巴黎</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> 人类的约会恋爱究竟是什么</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 在现实生活中罕有的，觉得自己特别的时刻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 30岁的时候才懂这部剧的好</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 垃圾电视像垃圾食品一样让人欲罢不能</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1870">31:10</a> 最新浪漫喜剧女主：考公务员考了8年都没考上</span><br><span></span><br><span>本期节目提到了以下剧集：</span><br><span>《还珠格格》</span><br><span>《粉红女郎》</span><br><span>《巴黎恋人》</span><br><span>《我的解放日志》</span><br><span>《秘密花园》</span><br><span>《我叫金三顺》</span><br><span>《艾米丽在巴黎》</span><br><span>《初恋》</span><br><span>《约会恋爱究竟是什么呢》</span><br><span>《虽然不是英雄》</span><br><span>《melo体质》</span><br><span>《杉杉来了》</span><br><span>《红苹果乐园》</span><br><span>《她的日与夜》</span><br><span></span><br><span>-</span><br><span>主播：绿宝 &amp; Orange </span><br><span>剪辑大师：小e </span><br><span>音乐总监：Bonsai </span><br><span>微博 @绿宝再次苏醒 @OrangeElephantSalmon </span><br><span>商务合作：suliaodaipod@gmail.com </span><br><span></span><br><span>感谢你的留言、点赞、收藏和分享！也欢迎有闲钱和大爱的听友们点击文末打赏支持我们。</span><br></p><span></span><hr><p><a href="https://afdian.com/a/suliaodaipod" data-url="https://afdian.com/a/suliaodaipod"><span>爱发电上赞助</span></a></p>]]></description>
